      SixLabors.ImageSharp     NOT referenced by any source file TODAY - declared for
                               TASK 8.6, which rewrites RoxyFilemanController.cs and the
                               ColorTranslator sites (design section 7). Declared here so
                               8.6 does not have to reopen the project file, exactly as
                               task 7.1 declared Autofac.Extensions.DependencyInjection
